            "sid": "JOB 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then answered Bildad the Shuhite, and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dominion and fear",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.25.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.25.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with him, he maketh peace in his high places.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is there any number of his armies? and upon whom doth not his light arise?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How then can man be justified with God? or how can he be clean",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.25.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.25.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "born of a woman?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold even to the moon, and it shineth not; yea, the stars are not pure in his sight.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How much less man,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.25.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.25.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a worm? and the son of man,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.25.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.25.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a worm?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.25.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
